---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Our kitchen — Cookbook" path="/about">
  <main class="wrap about-page" id="main">
    <p class="eyebrow">A note from our kitchen</p>
    <h1>
      A family
      <br />
      <em>recipe book.</em>
    </h1>
    <div class="about-layout">
      <div class="about-prose">
        <p>This is Cookbook: the recipes we cook at home, gathered in one place.</p>
        <p>
          There are Puerto Rican staples, everyday meals, breakfasts, and things to bake. Some
          recipes have an English and a Spanish version. The language link on each recipe takes you
          to its twin.
        </p>
        <p>
          Each recipe puts the ingredients, equipment, and method up front. Check off ingredients as
          you go, print a copy, or turn on kitchen mode while you cook.
        </p>
        <p>
          The garlic bulb and strawberry are our kitchen companions: a little savory, a little
          sweet.
        </p>
        <p>
          For the stories around the food, there’s{' '}
          <a
            href="https://notes.antoniwan.online/p/i-didnt-start-cooking-for-love"
            data-umami-event="cta"
            data-umami-event-label="cooking-for-love"
          >
            I Didn’t Start Cooking for Love
          </a>{' '}
          on Notes.
        </p>
        <a
          class="button"
          href="/#recipes"
          data-umami-event="cta"
          data-umami-event-label="back-to-recipes"
        >
          Back to the recipes ↗
        </a>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/mascots.webp"
        width="1536"
        height="1024"
        alt="Cookbook’s garlic bulb and strawberry mascots."
      />
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
